---
import "../../styles/style.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy | Eggsplode</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/eggsplode_logo.png" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>
      <a href="../">phorb.dev</a>{" "}&gt;&gt;{" "}
      <a href="."
        ><img
          src="/images/eggsplode_logo.png"
          alt="Bot icon"
          height="40"
        />Eggsplode</a
      >{" "}
      &gt;&gt;{" "}<span class="bigger">Privacy Policy</span>
    </h1>
    <p>By using Eggsplode, you agree to the privacy policy.</p>

    <div class="left-aligned">
      <h2>What we store</h2>
      <p>
        Eggsplode stores your public Discord user ID when you interact with the
        bot. In the database, your user ID is only associated with internal game
        data, such as achievements and games played. Personal information, such
        as your email address, phone number, friends, and messages, is not
        stored or accessed by Eggsplode.
      </p>
      <p>
        Eggsplode might also store data about channels where it is used in
        temporary logs. This does not include any messages or personal
        information, although it may occasionally include public or private
        channel IDs and implicit information about permissions and server
        settings.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use your data</h2>
      <p>
        The data collected by Eggsplode is solely to make the app function
        correctly and to improve your experience. This includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tracking your progress and achievements in the game</li>
        <li>
          Fixing bugs and improving the app proactively or in reaction to user
          feedback
        </li>
        <li>Analyzing usage patterns to improve the app</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not use your data for commercial purposes, such as selling your
        information or using it for targeted advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>What we share</h2>
      <p>We do not share any of the user data we collect with third parties.</p>

      <h2>Which permissions we have</h2>
      <p>
        Eggsplode does not use any additional Discord app intents. It has no
        access to messages and cannot get information about users who did not
        interact with it.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or concerns, please contact us at
        iqnitetechnologies@gmail.com.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
